    "Own-role scoped signer and one root-pair authenticated durable stage store.",
    "Exact stage replay after descendants and restart; two-stage adoption without receipt self-reference.",
    "Public registry record validation, signed exact Anchor CAS, nonce-bound replies and original-attempt query.",
